        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendall Jenner, Kylie Jenner, Emily Kai Bock\n- Events: 2014 Much Music Video Awards\n- Organizations: E!, Prism Prize\n- Works: Keeping Up with the Kardashians, Afterlife\n- Brands: Kylie Jenner cosmetics\n- Music Artists: Arcade Fire\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, Kendall Jenner and Kylie Jenner served as co-hosts of the 2014 Much Music Video Awards.\n- In 2014, Emily Kai Bock won the Prism Prize for her video for Arcade Fire's song \"Afterlife.\"\n- In 2014, Emily Kai Bock was nominated for Director of the Year at the 2014 Much Music Video Awards.\n- Since age nine, Kylie Jenner has been best known for starring in the E! reality television series \"Keeping Up with the Kardashians,\" her eponymous cosmetics brand, and her large social media presence.",
